This distribution contains modifications to the upstream Zentral project.

TheOutdoorProgrammer community modifications include:
- Independent OIDC account authentication, identity storage and security tests.
- Community runtime and image exclusion of enterprise modules and their routes.
- Privacy-filtered OpenTelemetry traces/logs and Grafana Faro browser telemetry.
- Community build, configuration and architecture documentation.

